Package: padUptakeEICU
Title: Early Uptake of Pain, Agitation and Delirium Assessment in 208 US ICUs
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Fabrice T.", "Nyambod", email = "ntiku2@jh.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0006-6592-2673")),
    person("January G.", "Msemakweli", role = "aut"),
    person("Aja", "Claris", role = "aut"),
    person("Murishi", "Onesphore", role = "aut"),
    person("Victor", "Okpanachi", role = "aut"))
Description: Analysis pipeline for a retrospective cohort study of documented
    pain, agitation and delirium assessment across 208 US intensive care units
    in the eICU Collaborative Research Database, 2014-2015. This is a research
    compendium rather than an installable package: the DESCRIPTION exists to
    declare the dependency set and the R version the analysis was run under.
